{{2025 UCI Road World Championships}}

The '''[[UCI Road World Championships&nbsp;– Women's time trial|Women's time trial]]''' of the [[2025 UCI Road World Championships]] was a cycling event that took place on 21 September 2025 in [[Kigali]], [[Rwanda]]. It was the 32nd edition of the championship, for which [[Grace Brown (cyclist)|Grace Brown]] of [[Australia]] was the defending champion, having won in [[2024 UCI Road World Championships&nbsp;– Women's time trial|2024]].<ref>{{cite web|url=https://ucikigali2025.rw/competition-program/women-elite-2/|title=Women's Elite Time Trial|accessdate=21 September 2025}}</ref><ref>{{cite news|url=https://www.cyclingnews.com/races/uci-road-world-championships-2025/elite-women-road-race/results/|title=Road World Championships: Marlen Reusser delivers in Kigali to take first elite women's time trial title|publisher=CyclingNews|first=Katy|last=Madgwick|date=21 September 2025|accessdate=21 September 2025}}</ref>

